function %fmin_f32x4(f32x4, f32x4) -> f32x4 {
block0(v0: f32x4, v1: f32x4):
    v2 = fmin v0, v1
    return v2
}
; run: %fmin_f32x4([-0x0.0 0x0.0 +NaN 0x1.0p0], [0x0.0 -0x0.0 0x1.0p0 +NaN]) == [-0x0.0 -0x0.0 +NaN +NaN]
; run: %fmin_f32x4([-Inf +Inf 0x1.0p0 -0x1.0p1], [0x1.0p0 0x1.0p0 0x1.000002p0 -0x1.0p0]) == [-Inf 0x1.0p0 0x1.0p0 -0x1.0p1]
; run: %fmin_f32x4([+NaN -NaN 0x1.0p-149 -0x1.0p-149], [+NaN 0x0.0 0x0.0 0x0.0]) == [+NaN +NaN 0x0.0 -0x1.0p-149]

